      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay that makes sense. so if i use it like 90% of the time for work, i just claim 90% of the cost? also i have some other weird stuff like a bunch of small software subscriptions and some random office snacks i bought for clients. do i have to track those individually or can i just group them under \"office supplies\"?",
